          "content": "Write down the starting composition, defect-sensitive atmosphere and powder or glass history; define whether reported fractions are by area, mass, moles or volume; and record the process history that could alter **binder, water content and consolidation direction**. For any local observation, describe why its sampling plan represents the part. Treat **agglomerate or drying bands** as an explicit rival explanation and plan **green-body cross-sectional imaging** as an independent check.",
