          "content": "Write down the starting composition, defect-sensitive atmosphere and powder or glass history; define whether reported fractions are by area, mass, moles or volume; and record the process history that could alter **process traceability and functional unit**. For any local observation, describe why its sampling plan represents the part. Treat **unmeasured durability or yield losses** as an explicit rival explanation and plan **held-out service tests and audited inventory** as an independent check.",
